description:
Enroll a contact into a 0nFlow. Materializes every step in the flow
as a scheduled flow_step; the cron at /api/cron/flows fires them on time.

Pass either flow_id (UUID) or flow_slug.

Example:
  flow_enroll({
    flow_slug: "sxo-free-scan-nurture",
    contact_email: "rob@outlookfinancial.com",
    contact_id: "abc123",
    contact_data: { domain: "outlookfinancial.com", score: 47, grade: "F", scanId: "scan_xyz" }
  })
